OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 18 Aug to Thu 27 AugFA
OL,6,Frather more changeable spell of
OL,7,Fweather through the mid to latter part
OL,8,Fof August, with Atlantic frontal
OL,9,Fsystems bringing some rain or showers
OL,10,Fat times to the UK. The heavier and
OL,11,Fmore reliable rainfall is more likely
OL,12,Fto be in parts of the west and
OL,13,Fnorthwest, but it is possible that
OL,14,Fsome southern and eastern areas will
OL,15,Fsee rain at times too. Later in the
OL,16,Fperiod high pressure may have more of
OL,17,Fan influence with drier conditions
OL,18,Freturning for many areas. Temperatures
OL,19,Fare likely to remain above average
OL,20,Foverall, with the possibility of
OL,21,Ffurther hot weather developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
